WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000021392 — Episode 24 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:05.630
This is absurd.

2
00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:08.970
Two days ago, I was merely the headmaster's attendant.

3
00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:11.990
A walking dragon repellent.

4
00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:13.310
And now...

5
00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:25.110
For all those years, the headmaster called me Rotten Wood.

6
00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:29.770
Why did I suddenly become a prodigy the moment I stepped out of his academy?

7
00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:32.770
I told you, Aris!

8
00:00:32.770 --> 00:00:36.170
I told you that you were far more exceptional than you imagined.

9
00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:37.450
Four runes!

10
00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:41.130
You qualify to be the new commander of any order you choose.

11
00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:44.250
Well, Bay, still think he's not a worthy match for you?

12
00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:46.210
No.

13
00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:47.730
No way.

14
00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:49.690
I don't believe it.

15
00:00:49.690 --> 00:00:51.610
The astrolate is rigged!

16
00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:54.210
He must have used some dark magic to fool us!

17
00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:56.410
Let the gutter rat have his moment, Bay.

18
00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:59.970
A spark doesn't mean a damn thing without the resources to back it up.

19
00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:01.770
We have the feral magic.

20
00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:03.370
He'll never touch our ceiling.

21
00:01:04.490 --> 00:01:07.250
The stone only measures raw potential, boy.

22
00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:09.650
It doesn't grant you the skill to wield it.

23
00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:13.090
You haven't spent a single day in any Dragon Knight Academy.

24
00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:15.450
To actually control four elements?

25
00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:19.330
You'd need 20 years of brutal conditioning just to keep from blowing yourself up.

26
00:01:19.330 --> 00:01:20.650
Exactly!

27
00:01:21.850 --> 00:01:24.650
You can have all the raw talent in the realm, Scrub.

28
00:01:25.370 --> 00:01:26.970
You don't have the pedigree.

29
00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:29.490
You're never gonna catch me.

30
00:01:29.490 --> 00:01:30.890
Take comfort, boy.

31
00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:33.250
By the time you actually finish Squire training,

32
00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:37.050
Lord Lucian and Lady Beatrix's children will be your commanders.

33
00:01:37.090 --> 00:01:38.850
It will be the honor of your life.

34
00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:57.060
My toxic blood is just scrambling the senses.

35
00:01:57.060 --> 00:01:59.100
That is the only logical explanation.

36
00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:00.940
Six elements.

37
00:02:00.940 --> 00:02:03.180
He just matched my ceiling.

38
00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:06.340
This is completely ridiculous!
